===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fa|en}} {{term|ستان|ـستان|tr=-estān|lang=fa}}, from {{etyl|pal|en}} {{term|-stʾn'|tr=-estān|lang=pal}}, from {{etyl|peo|en}} {{term|𐎿𐎫𐎠𐎴|tr=stāna-|lang=peo}}, from {{etyl|ira-pro|en}} {{term/t|ira-pro|*stāna-}}, from {{etyl|iir-pro|en}} {{term/t|iir-pro|*sthāna}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*steh₂-||to stand}}, whence also English verbs {{term|stay|lang=en}} and {{term|stand|lang=en}}. Compare {{etyl|ae|-}} {{term|𐬯𐬙𐬁𐬥𐬀|tr=stāna-|lang=ae}} and {{etyl|sa|-}} {{term|स्थान|tr=sthā́na|lang=sa}}.

